			"date": "2024-04-29T14:33:13.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I looked into this for the day job, but there’s no value unless you specifically want to use the variability.</p>",
